---
interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  ogTitle?: string;
  ogDescription?: string;
  ogImage?: string;
  ogType?: string;
  jsonLd?: Record<string, unknown>;
  current?: string;
  noindex?: boolean;
}

const {
  title,
  description,
  ogTitle = title,
  ogDescription = description,
  ogImage = '/assets/cooking.jpg',
  ogType = 'website',
  jsonLd,
  current,
  noindex = false,
} = Astro.props;

const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site).href;
const organization = {
  '@type': 'Organization',
  '@id': 'https://kookgereigids.nl/#organization',
  name: 'Kookgereigids',
  url: 'https://kookgereigids.nl/',
  email: 'info@kookgereigids.nl',
  founder: { '@id': 'https://kookgereigids.nl/over-ons/#kees' },
};
const structuredData = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': jsonLd ? [organization, { ...jsonLd, url: canonical }] : [organization],
};

const nav = [
  { key: 'home', href: '/', label: 'Home' },
  { key: 'over-ons', href: '/over-ons/', label: 'Over ons' },
  { key: 'koopadvies', href: '/koopadvies/', label: 'Koopadvies' },
  { key: 'keuzehulp', href: '/keuzehulp/', label: 'Keuzehulp' },
  { key: 'blog', href: '/blog/', label: 'Blog' },
  { key: 'contact', href: '/contact/', label: 'Contact' },
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{title}</title>
<meta name="description" content={description}>
{noindex ? <meta name="robots" content="noindex"> : <link rel="canonical" href={canonical}>}
<meta name="theme-color" content="#fffbf5">
<meta property="og:type" content={ogType}>
<meta property="og:locale" content="nl_NL">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Kookgereigids">
<meta property="og:url" content={canonical}>
<meta property="og:title" content={ogTitle}>
<meta property="og:description" content={ogDescription}>
<meta property="og:image" content={new URL(ogImage, Astro.site).href}>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Ctext y='.9em' font-size='90'%3E🍳%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="sitemap" href="/sitemap-index.xml">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css?v=5">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(structuredData)} />
</head>
<body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Direct naar de inhoud</a><div class="announcement"><div class="container"><span>EERLIJK KOOPADVIES. VOOR JOUW KEUKEN.</span><span>Van eerste pannenset tot favoriete koekenpan</span></div></div><header class="site-header"><div class="container header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Kookgereigids, naar home"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><ellipse cx="9" cy="14" rx="6" ry="4"/><path d="m15 13 7-7M5 8c-2-2 2-3 0-5M10 7c-2-2 2-3 0-5"/></svg><span>kookgerei<em>gids</em></span></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Hoofdnavigatie">{nav.map((item) => <a href={item.href} aria-current={item.key === current ? 'page' : undefined}>{item.label}</a>)}</nav><a class="button header-cta" href="/keuzehulp/">Vind jouw pan<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><details class="mobile-nav"><summary><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"/></svg>Menu</summary><nav aria-label="Mobiele hoofdnavigatie">{nav.map((item) => <a href={item.href} aria-current={item.key === current ? 'page' : undefined}>{item.label}</a>)}</nav></details></div></header><main id="main">
<slot />
</main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="container footer-main"><div class="footer-brand"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Kookgereigids, naar home"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><ellipse cx="9" cy="14" rx="6" ry="4"/><path d="m15 13 7-7M5 8c-2-2 2-3 0-5M10 7c-2-2 2-3 0-5"/></svg><span>kookgerei<em>gids</em></span></a><p>Eerlijk advies over pannen, van een thuiskok voor thuiskoks. Ik zoek het uit, jij maakt er iets lekkers van.</p></div><div><h2 class="footer-heading">Op het menu</h2><ul class="footer-links">{nav.map((item) => <li><a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a></li>)}</ul></div><div><h2 class="footer-heading">Goed om te weten</h2><ul class="footer-links"><li><a href="/over-ons/#werkwijze">Zo kom ik tot mijn advies</a></li><li><a href="/over-ons/#affiliate">Hoe deze site wordt betaald</a></li><li><a href="/contact/#privacy">Jouw privacy</a></li><li><a href="/over-ons/#werkwijze">Mijn werkwijze</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-contact"><h2 class="footer-heading">Schuif gerust aan</h2><a href="mailto:info@kookgereigids.nl">info@kookgereigids.nl</a><p>Een vraag over pannen?<br>We horen graag van je.</p><p class="small">Deel Kookgereigids</p><div class="social-links"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fkookgereigids.nl%2F" aria-label="Deel Kookgereigids op Facebook" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 22V13h3l1-4h-4V6c0-1 .5-2 2-2h2V1h-3c-3 0-5 2-5 5v3H7v4h3v9"/></svg></a><a href="https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkookgereigids.nl%2F&amp;description=Eerlijk%20advies%20over%20kookgerei" aria-label="Deel Kookgereigids op Pinterest" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 22 12 7m-1 7c1 4 7 3 8-2 2-9-11-13-15-5-2 4-1 7 2 9"/></svg></a><a href="mailto:?subject=Eerlijk%20advies%20over%20kookgerei&amp;body=https%3A%2F%2Fkookgereigids.nl%2F" aria-label="Deel Kookgereigids via e-mail"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m2 6 10 7L22 6"/></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="container footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Kookgereigids · Met aandacht voor jouw keuken.</span><span>Gemaakt in Haarlem door Kees, met liefde voor koken.</span></div></footer></body>
</html>
